OL,3,GNEWSAVictims' anger after 'house of
OL,4,Ahorrors' foster carer released
OL,5,
OL,6,FA foster carer who abused children in
OL,7,Fher care has been released from prison
OL,8,Fafter her sentence was reduced on
OL,9,Fappeal.
OL,11,FBarbara Daniel and her husband Douglas
OL,12,Fwere found guilty in January of abusing
OL,13,Fsix foster children - aged between four
OL,14,Fand 14 - at their home in Glasgow's
OL,15,FParkhead between 1986 and 1991.
OL,17,FThe 76-year-old was jailed for
OL,18,Ftwo-and-a-half years in March, but her
OL,19,Fsuccessful appeal saw it cut to just
OL,20,Fover five months.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
