OL,3,GNEWSAVictims' anger after 'house of
OL,4,Ahorrors' foster carer released
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer eligibility for release was set at
OL,7,F81 days, meaning Daniel was free to go
OL,8,Fgiven the time she has already spent in
OL,9,Fcustody.
